:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Shaman Khan (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Shaman Khan''' (シャーマンカーン ''Shāmankān'') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy that appears in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Shaman Khan
|image = E 519.png
|appearance = [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 3,100¢ - 12,245¢
}}

==Enemy==
Shaman Khan is the weakest of the three ''[[The Angels Strike!]]'' bosses in both health and attack power. He mainly serves to [[Knockback|knockback]] Cat Units from long range. He does have a blind spot, but it's completely covered by Herchrist's Omni Strike in the stages he appears in.

==Strategy==
:''See [[The Angels Strike!]] for strategies.''

